#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: etbs-account-guard.php inc/class-acgd-settings.php:194
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:195
msgid "ETBS Account Guard"
msgstr "ETBS Account Guard"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: etbs-account-guard.php
msgid "https://etbs.jp/product/etbs-account-guard/"
msgstr "https://etbs.jp/product/etbs-account-guard/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: etbs-account-guard.php
msgid ""
"Protects the accounts that manage your site. Hides the login names of your "
"users from visitors who are not logged in."
msgstr ""
"サイトを管理するアカウントを守ります。ログインしていない訪問者から、ユーザー"
"のログイン名を隠します。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: etbs-account-guard.php
msgid "ETBS (DAI)"
msgstr "ETBS (DAI)"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: etbs-account-guard.php
msgid "https://etbs.jp"
msgstr "https://etbs.jp"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:986
msgid "The username or password was not accepted"
msgstr "ユーザー名またはパスワードが受け付けられませんでした"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:987 inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:990
msgid ""
"This screen protects your account with a second username and password (BASIC "
"authentication), separate from your WordPress login."
msgstr ""
"この画面は、WordPress のログインとは別の2つ目のユーザー名とパスワード (BASIC "
"認証) でアカウントを守っています。"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:989
msgid "A second sign-in is required"
msgstr "2つ目のサインインが必要です"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:995
msgid ""
"If a username/password prompt did not appear, use the link below to try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"ユーザー名とパスワードの入力欄が表示されなかった場合は、下のリンクからもう一"
"度お試しください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:996
msgid ""
"If you no longer have the second username and password, contact your site "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"2つ目のユーザー名とパスワードが分からなくなった場合は、サイトの管理者にお問い"
"合わせください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1007
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "もう一度試す"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1012
msgid "Log out"
msgstr "ログアウト"

#. translators: %s: site name, used as the realm shown in the browser's BASIC authentication prompt
#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1045
#, php-format
msgid "%s Staff Access"
msgstr "%s 関係者専用"

#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1237 inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1531
#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:1940 inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:3564
#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:3590
msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "この操作を行う権限がありません。"

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code of the diagnosis request's response
#: inc/class-acgd-basic-auth.php:2026
#, php-format
msgid "Unexpected response to the diagnosis request (status: %d)."
msgstr "診断リクエストへの応答が想定外でした (ステータス: %d)。"

#: inc/class-acgd-invalid-credentials.php:88
msgid "The username or password you entered is incorrect."
msgstr "ユーザー名またはパスワードが正しくありません。"

#: inc/class-acgd-invalid-credentials.php:102 inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:1748
#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:2386 inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:2693
msgid "Error:"
msgstr "エラー:"

#: inc/class-acgd-invalid-credentials.php:105
msgid "Lost your password?"
msgstr "パスワードをお忘れですか ?"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:145
msgid "Login Name Protection"
msgstr "ログイン名の保護"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:146 inc/class-acgd-user-access.php:366
#: inc/class-acgd-user-access.php:1118
msgid "Access Restriction"
msgstr "アクセス制限"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:150 inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4485
#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4786
msgid "Two-Step Verification"
msgstr "2段階認証"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:152
msgid "Denial Log"
msgstr "拒否の記録"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:230
msgid "Protection items"
msgstr "保護する項目"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:291 inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1560
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST API"

#. translators: %s: REST API route of the users, such as /wp/v2/users
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hide the user information of the REST API (%s) from visitors who are not "
"logged in"
msgstr "REST API のユーザー情報 (%s) を、ログインしていない訪問者には返さない"

#. translators: %s: address of the user list of the REST API, such as /wp-json/wp/v2/users
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:300
#, php-format
msgid ""
"While this is off, anyone can see the list of users and their login names by "
"opening %s in a browser."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、ブラウザーで %s を開くだけで、誰でもユーザーの一覧とログイン名を"
"見られます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:303
msgid ""
"Themes and apps that read author names through the REST API without logging "
"in, such as headless sites, will no longer get them."
msgstr ""
"ログインせずに REST API から投稿者名を読み込むテーマやアプリ (ヘッドレス構成"
"など) では、投稿者名が表示されなくなります。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:304
msgid "Logged-in users, including the block editor, can use them as before."
msgstr "ログイン中のユーザー (ブロックエディターを含む) は従来どおり使えます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:308
msgid "Embeds (oEmbed)"
msgstr "埋め込み (oEmbed)"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:309
msgid "Use the site name and home page URL as the author of embedded posts"
msgstr "埋め込まれた投稿の投稿者を、サイト名とトップページの URL にする"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:311
msgid ""
"While this is off, a post embedded on another site carries the address of "
"the author page, which contains the login name."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、他のサイトに埋め込まれた投稿の情報に、ログイン名を含む投稿者ペー"
"ジのアドレスが入ります。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:315
msgid "Sitemap"
msgstr "サイトマップ"

#. translators: %s: file name of the user sitemap, such as wp-sitemap-users-1.xml
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:318
#, php-format
msgid "Remove the user sitemap (%s)"
msgstr "ユーザーのサイトマップ (%s) を出さない"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:322
msgid ""
"While this is off, the user sitemap lists author page addresses, which "
"contain login names."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、ユーザーのサイトマップに、ログイン名を含む投稿者ページのアドレス"
"が並びます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:323
msgid "Sitemaps of posts and pages are not affected."
msgstr "投稿と固定ページのサイトマップには影響しません。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:327
msgid "HTML class names"
msgstr "HTML のクラス名"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:328
msgid "Remove class names that contain the login name"
msgstr "ログイン名を含むクラス名を外す"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:330
msgid ""
"While this is off, the HTML of comments by registered users and of author "
"pages contains class names with the login name."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、登録ユーザーのコメントと投稿者ページの HTML に、ログイン名を含む"
"クラス名が付きます。"

#. translators: 1: class name added to comments by registered users, 2: class name added to author pages
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:333
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This removes %1$s from comments by registered users and %2$s from author "
"pages."
msgstr "登録ユーザーのコメントから %1$s を、投稿者ページから %2$s を外します。"

#. translators: %s: example of a class name that contains the user ID
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:339
#, php-format
msgid "Class names that contain the user ID, such as %s, are kept."
msgstr "%s のようなユーザー ID を含むクラス名は残します。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:342
msgid ""
"If your custom CSS uses these class names, that CSS will no longer apply."
msgstr ""
"これらのクラス名を使った CSS を書いている場合は、その CSS が効かなくなりま"
"す。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:346
msgid "Author ID links"
msgstr "投稿者 ID のリンク"

#. translators: %s: example of a link by author number, such as /?author=1
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:349
#, php-format
msgid "Redirect links by author number, such as %s, to the home page"
msgstr "%s のような投稿者番号のリンクをトップページへ転送する"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:353
msgid ""
"While this is off, WordPress sends these links to the author page, whose "
"address contains the login name."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、WordPress がこのリンクを、アドレスにログイン名を含む投稿者ページ"
"へ転送します。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:354
msgid "Filtering by author in the admin screens is not affected."
msgstr "管理画面での投稿者による絞り込みには影響しません。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:358
msgid "Login errors"
msgstr "ログインエラー"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:359
msgid "Show the same error for an unknown username and a wrong password"
msgstr "存在しないユーザー名とパスワードの誤りで、同じエラーを出す"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:361
msgid "While this is off, the error message tells whether the username exists."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、エラーの文言の違いから、そのユーザー名が登録されているかどうかが"
"分かります。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:362
msgid ""
"On the lost password screen, an unknown username or email address shows the "
"same screen as a registered one."
msgstr ""
"パスワード再発行の画面では、登録されていないユーザー名やメールアドレスを入力"
"しても、登録済みのときと同じ画面を表示します。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:363
msgid "Registered users receive the password reset email as before."
msgstr "登録済みのユーザーには、従来どおり再設定のメールが届きます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:364
msgid ""
"Errors from other plugins, such as CAPTCHA or login lockout, are shown as "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"画像認証やログインロックなど、他のプラグインのエラーはそのまま表示します。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:368
msgid "Author pages"
msgstr "投稿者ページ"

#. translators: %s: URL of an author page, such as /author/{name}
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Show a \"Page not found\" screen instead of author pages (%s) to visitors "
"who are not logged in"
msgstr ""
"ログインしていない訪問者には、投稿者ページ (%s) の代わりに「ページが見つかり"
"ません」を表示する"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:375
msgid ""
"While this is off, the address of each author page contains the login name, "
"so anyone who follows a link to it can see the login name."
msgstr ""
"オフの間は、投稿者ページのアドレスにログイン名が含まれるため、そのページへの"
"リンクからログイン名が分かります。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:376
msgid ""
"Before turning this on, open a post on your site and click the author name."
msgstr "オンにする前に、サイトの投稿で投稿者名をクリックしてみてください。"

#. translators: %s: the part that the address of every author page contains, such as /author
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:379
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If a page whose address contains %s opens, your theme links to author pages, "
"and those links will lead to \"Page not found\"."
msgstr ""
"アドレスに %s を含むページが開く場合は、テーマが投稿者ページへリンクしている"
"ため、オンにするとそのリンク先が「ページが見つかりません」になります。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:382
msgid ""
"While you are logged in, author pages are shown as before, so check the "
"result in a private window of your browser."
msgstr ""
"ログイン中は従来どおり表示されるため、結果はブラウザーのプライベートウィンド"
"ウで確かめてください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:444
msgid "Settings tabs"
msgstr "設定のタブ"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:514
msgid ""
"WordPress reveals login names to visitors who are not logged in at several "
"places, and each item below closes one of them."
msgstr ""
"WordPress には、ログインしていない訪問者にもログイン名が分かってしまう場所が"
"複数あり、下の各項目がそれぞれ1か所を塞ぎます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:515
msgid ""
"Keep them on, and turn one off only if your theme or another plugin stops "
"working as expected after you activate this plugin."
msgstr ""
"通常はオンのままにし、有効化した後にテーマや他のプラグインの表示・動作がおか"
"しくなった場合にだけ、関係する項目をオフにしてください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:522
msgid ""
"\"Author pages\" is off by default; read its description before turning it "
"on."
msgstr ""
"「投稿者ページ」は既定でオフのため、説明を読んだうえでオンにしてください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:573
msgid "Users whose public name is their login name"
msgstr "公開される名前がログイン名と同じユーザー"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:579
msgid ""
"Display names and nicknames are shown to visitors, for example as the author "
"of posts and comments and in feeds."
msgstr ""
"表示名とニックネームは、投稿やコメントの投稿者、フィードなどで訪問者に表示さ"
"れます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:580
msgid ""
"For each user below, open the profile, change the nickname, and choose a "
"different name in \"Display name publicly as\"."
msgstr ""
"下の各ユーザーのプロフィールを開き、ニックネームを変えたうえで「ブログ上の表"
"示名」で別の名前を選んでください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:581
msgid "This plugin does not change them automatically."
msgstr "このプラグインは自動では変更しません。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:591
msgid ""
"No users have a display name or nickname that is the same as their login "
"name."
msgstr "表示名またはニックネームがログイン名と同じユーザーはいません。"

#. translators: 1: number of users shown, 2: number of matching users
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:602
#, php-format
msgid "Showing the first %1$d of %2$d users."
msgstr "%2$d人中、最初の%1$d人を表示しています。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:614 inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1438
#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4320
msgid "Login name (Username)"
msgstr "ログイン名 (ユーザー名)"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:615
msgid "Display name"
msgstr "表示名"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:616
msgid "Nickname"
msgstr "ニックネーム"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:631
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "編集"

#. translators: %s: display name or nickname that is the same as the login name
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:662
#, php-format
msgid "%s (same as the login name)"
msgstr "%s (ログイン名と同じ)"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:695
msgid "Restriction by role"
msgstr "権限による制限"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:701
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "権限"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:709
msgid "Site-wide IP list"
msgstr "サイトの IP 一覧"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:715
msgid "Allowed IP addresses"
msgstr "許可する IP アドレス"

#. translators: 1: line number, 2: the line's content
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:767
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Line %1$d of the site-wide IP list is not a valid IP address or range: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"サイトの IP 一覧の%1$d行目が、有効な IP アドレスまたは範囲ではありません: "
"%2$s"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:794
msgid ""
"This would leave no administrator (or other user who can manage options) "
"without a restriction. Change one of them back to \"No restriction\" here or "
"on their own user edit screen. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"この内容で保存すると、制限されていない管理者 (または他に設定を管理できるユー"
"ザー) が1人もいなくなります。どちらかを、ここかそのユーザー自身の編集画面で"
"「制限なし」に戻してください。保存しませんでした。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:812
msgid ""
"Your own account, from where you are connecting right now, would not satisfy "
"these new settings. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"今のあなたの接続元では、この新しい設定を満たせません。保存しませんでした。"

#. translators: %s: the current user's own IP address, to add to the site-wide IP list
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:815
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your own account would not satisfy these new settings: your current "
"connection (%s) is not on the list. Add it, or choose a setting that still "
"allows it. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"この新しい設定では、あなた自身のアクセスが満たせません。今の接続元 (%s) が一"
"覧に入っていません。この住所を一覧に追加するか、この住所からでも許可される設"
"定にしてください。保存しませんでした。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:836
msgid ""
"BASIC authentication mode cannot be turned on for a role because the receive "
"diagnosis below has not succeeded. Run it first. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"受信診断が成功していないため、権限を BASIC 認証モードにできません。先に下の診"
"断を実行してください。保存されませんでした。"

#. translators: 1: login name of a user who would end up in BASIC mode without credentials, 2: URL of that user's edit screen
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:857
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This would put %1$s in BASIC authentication mode without their own ID and "
"password set. Set them on their <a href=\"%2$s\">user edit screen</a> first, "
"or choose a different mode. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"この保存を行うと、%1$s が自分の ID とパスワードを設定しないまま BASIC 認証"
"モードになります。先に<a href=\"%2$s\">ユーザー編集画面</a>で設定するか、別の"
"モードを選んでください。保存されませんでした。"

#. translators: %s: login name of a user who would end up in BASIC mode without credentials
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:863
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This would put %s in BASIC authentication mode without their own ID and "
"password set. Set them on their user edit screen first, or choose a "
"different mode. Not saved."
msgstr ""
"この保存を行うと、%s が自分の ID とパスワードを設定しないまま BASIC 認証モー"
"ドになります。先にそのユーザーの編集画面で設定するか、別のモードを選んでくだ"
"さい。保存されませんでした。"

#. translators: %s: URL of the Two-Step Verification tab of the settings screen
#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:988
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Two-step verification is set on its own <a href=\"%s\">Two-Step Verification "
"tab</a>."
msgstr "2段階認証は、別の<a href=\"%s\">「2段階認証」タブ</a>で設定します。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1038
msgid "BASIC authentication receive diagnosis"
msgstr "BASIC 認証の受信診断"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1039
msgid ""
"Some server setups do not pass the username and password of BASIC "
"authentication through to WordPress, or already use BASIC authentication for "
"the whole site at the server level (only one such credential can be sent per "
"request). Run the diagnosis below to check this site before turning BASIC "
"authentication mode on for any role or user."
msgstr ""
"サーバーの構成によっては、BASIC 認証のユーザー名とパスワードが WordPress まで"
"届かないことや、すでにサーバー側でサイト全体に BASIC 認証がかかっていることが"
"あります (1回のリクエストに載せられる資格情報は1つだけです)。権限やユーザー"
"を BASIC 認証モードにする前に、下の診断でこのサイトを確認してください。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1045
msgid ""
"This connection is not HTTPS. BASIC authentication sends the username and "
"password with every request; using HTTPS is strongly recommended (this does "
"not block saving)."
msgstr ""
"この接続は HTTPS ではありません。BASIC 認証は毎回のリクエストでユーザー名とパ"
"スワードを送るため、HTTPS の利用を強く推奨します (保存は止めません)。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1052
msgid "Run diagnosis"
msgstr "診断を実行"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1073
msgid ""
"The diagnosis has not been run yet. BASIC authentication mode cannot be "
"turned on until it succeeds."
msgstr ""
"診断はまだ実行されていません。成功するまで BASIC 認証モードを有効にできませ"
"ん。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1082
msgid "Received. BASIC authentication can be turned on for this site."
msgstr "受信できています。このサイトで BASIC 認証を有効にできます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1086
msgid ""
"Not received. The username and password do not reach WordPress, so BASIC "
"authentication cannot be turned on until this is fixed."
msgstr ""
"受信できていません。ユーザー名とパスワードが WordPress まで届いていないため、"
"直すまで BASIC 認証を有効にできません。"

#: inc/class-acgd-settings.php:1090
msgid ""
"This server already requires a BASIC authentication sign-in of its own for "
"this address. Only one such credential can be sent per request, so this "
"plugin's BASIC authentication cannot be turned on at the same time."
msgstr ""
"このサーバーは、このアドレスに対してすでに自身の BASIC 認証のサインインを求め"
