msgid ""
"Two-step verification asks for a verification code sent to the user's "
"registered email address after the password has been accepted."
msgstr ""
"2段階認証は、パスワードが合った後に、登録メールアドレスへ送った確認コードの入"
"力を求めます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4169
msgid ""
"It is set separately from Access Restriction, and a user held to both goes "
"through both: first the password and IP restriction, then the verification "
"code, then BASIC authentication on the next screen."
msgstr ""
"アクセス制限とは別に設定し、両方が掛かる人は両方を通ります。順番は、パスワー"
"ドと IP 制限、確認コード、次の画面での BASIC 認証です。"

#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4170
msgid ""
"Unlike Access Restriction, it can also be turned on for the administrator "
"role."
msgstr "アクセス制限と違い、管理者の権限にも設定できます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4177
msgid ""
"Its strength depends on the email account: anyone who can read the user's "
