msgid ""
"On the verification code screen, a user can choose to skip the code on that "
"browser for this many days."
msgstr ""
"確認コードの入力画面で、そのブラウザーではこの日数のあいだコードを省略するよ"
"う選べます。"

#: inc/class-acgd-two-step.php:4272
msgid ""
"The password is still needed every time, and IP restriction and BASIC "
